flowchart LR

REQ["`One request: POST /api/v1/subjects`"]
  R0["`Traefik
routes by host · terminates TLS
attaches the real client IP`"]
REQ -.- R0
  R1["`SecurityHeaders — decorates every response, 429s included`"]
  R2["`RequestLogging — 1 JSON line: user, latency, trace_id`"]
  R3["`Rate limit (slowapi) — counters in Redis, so limits hold across replicas`"]
  R4["`CSRF — innermost: it only needs this request's own cookies`"]
  R0 --> R1 --> R2 --> R3 --> R4

LAY["`The module — 13 of these, all with the same 4 layers`"]

  L1["`PRESENTATION · presentation/
router + request/response schemas + deps
HTTP and nothing else
a malformed body dies here with 422`"]
LAY -.- L1
  L2["`APPLICATION · application/
SubjectService — the use case
owner taken from the authenticated user
stages the audit row in the same transaction`"]
  L3["`DOMAIN · domain/
entities · enums · interfaces · exceptions
plain Python — no FastAPI, no SQLAlchemy
deletable frameworks, surviving folder`"]
  L4["`INFRASTRUCTURE · infrastructure/
SQLAlchemy models + repository
owns the SQL · filters by user_id and deleted_at
the ONLY place a query is built`"]

  L1 -->|"calls"| L2
  L2 -->|"calls"| L4
  L2 -.->|"depends on the interface"| L3
  L4 -.->|"implements the interface"| L3

DB[("`PostgreSQL
subject + audit_logs
commit together or not at all`")]

R4 ==> L1
L4 ==> DB

RULE["`THE DEPENDENCY RULE
outer knows inner · never the reverse
the domain layer does not know
what HTTP is or what a database is`"]

INV["`THE ONE INVARIANT
user_id NEVER comes from the request body
it comes from the auth cookie
and the repository filters by it

routers are forbidden from touching the DB
so the ownership filter is structure,
not something a developer must remember

one forgotten filter = teacher reads teacher`"]

TRADE["`WHY MODULAR MONOLITH
one deployable · borders held by structure
bought: no distributed transactions,
no network failure per pair, light ops
paid: no independent deploy/scale per module
borders drawn where I WOULD cut later —
the option stays open, it is not closed`"]

LAY --- RULE
LAY --- INV
LAY --- TRADE

